00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:03,230
million pounds and it can't hold

3
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,820
up one man in pajamas.

4
00:00:04,874 --> 00:00:06,574
It's two on a Sunday afternoon

5
00:00:06,814 --> 00:00:08,354
and Gus lies in his garden

6
00:00:08,364 --> 00:00:09,884
staring at a fat little cloud.

7
00:00:09,938 --> 00:00:11,288
It looks like the softest bed

8
00:00:11,298 --> 00:00:11,988
in the world.

9
00:00:12,032 --> 00:00:13,602
His wife says it's just fog

10
00:00:13,762 --> 00:00:14,732
and his neighbor bets he'll

11
