12
00:00:15,336 --> 00:00:16,796
So Gus puts on a parachute,

13
00:00:17,016 --> 00:00:18,646
borrows a balloon and rides up

14
00:00:18,656 --> 00:00:19,396
above the cloud.

15
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:21,270
Up close the cloud looks solid.

16
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:23,140
It holds five hundred tons of

17
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:24,770
water, as much as a hundred

18
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:25,450
