20
00:00:26,388 --> 00:00:27,298
He doesn't bounce.

21
00:00:27,418 --> 00:00:28,778
He doesn't even slow down.

22
00:00:28,832 --> 00:00:29,992
He falls through the whole thing

23
00:00:30,002 --> 00:00:31,762
in twenty two seconds and all

24
00:00:31,772 --> 00:00:32,772
