25
00:00:32,826 --> 00:00:33,806
So where are the hundred

26
00:00:33,816 --> 00:00:34,496
elephants?

27
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:36,230
You see, a cloud is huge.

28
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:37,550
A piece the size of your

29
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,320
fridge holds just ten drops of

30
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:39,780
water.

31
00:00:39,824 --> 00:00:40,904
The rest is air.

32
00:00:41,204 --> 00:00:42,854
Each droplet is so tiny that

33
00:00:42,864 --> 00:00:43,914
it sinks half an inch a

34
