38
00:00:49,332 --> 00:00:51,242
In his whole fall Gus runs

39
00:00:51,252 --> 00:00:52,442
into one cup of water.

40
00:00:52,496 --> 00:00:54,176
Luckily, his parachute opens and

41
00:00:54,186 --> 00:00:55,626
he lands in his own garden,

42
00:00:55,846 --> 00:00:56,676
